{"id":"ed-ing-adjectives","lv":"b1","n":29,"cat":"adjectives","t":"Bored hay boring? Tính từ -ed và -ing","en":"I'm bored. · The film is boring.","kind":"contrast","sum":"Tính từ -ed nói NGƯỜI cảm thấy thế nào (bored, interested, tired, excited, confused, surprised, worried, embarrassed). Tính từ -ing nói thứ / việc / người GÂY RA cảm xúc ấy (boring, interesting, tiring, exciting, confusing, surprising). The movie was boring, so I was bored. Cẩn thận: I'm boring = tôi là người nhạt nhẽo. Đuôi -ed đọc như quá khứ: bored /d/, excited /ɪd/, embarrassed /t/.","forms":[{"f":"người + -ed = cảm thấy","vi":"I was bored."},{"f":"thứ / việc + -ing = gây ra cảm xúc","vi":"The movie was boring."},{"f":"I'm bored ≠ I'm boring","vi":"tôi thấy chán ≠ tôi nhạt nhẽo"},{"f":"interested · excited · tired · confused · surprised","vi":"cảm xúc thường gặp"}],"pts":[{"id":"adjectives-ed-ing","name":"-ed vs -ing adjectives","vi":"Bored (cảm thấy) khác boring (gây ra cảm giác)"}],"cast":{"ana":{"name":{"en":"Ana","vi":"Ana"},"look":"woman","style":{"outfit":"jacket","top":"#8C3B4A","topShade":"#76303D","accent":"#A23B55","hair":"curly","hairColor":"#2B1D18","skin":"#8D5A3C","skinShade":"#784A30"},"x":560},"ben":{"name":{"en":"Ben","vi":"Ben"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"jacket","top":"#5A6B8C","topShade":"#4A5A78","accent":"#4A5F8F","hair":"short","hairColor":"#B8863B"},"x":1040}},"bg":"street","beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"That movie was so boring!","vi":"Bộ phim đó chán quá!","ipa":["ðæt","ˈmuvi","wɑz","soʊ","ˈbɔɹɪŋ"],"who":"ana","ann":{"expression":"tired"},"b":1,"start":0.454,"end":1.904,"timing":[[0,0.454],[1,0.61],[2,0.923],[3,1.118],[4,1.366]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Really? I was really interested in the story.","vi":"Thật á? Anh lại thấy câu chuyện rất cuốn.","ipa":["ˈɹɪli","aɪ","wɑz","ˈɹɪli","ˈɪntɹəstɪd","ɪn","ðə","ˈstɔɹi"],"who":"ben","ann":{"expression":"surprised"},"b":1,"start":2.694,"end":5.604,"timing":[[0,2.694],[1,3.764],[2,3.907],[3,4.141],[4,4.467],[5,4.9